    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Realistic brachiosaurus in a walking pose with the long neck raised, sandy-ochre skin with slate-blue dorsal mottling, a cream underside, believable skin folds at the joints, columnar limbs with modelled toes and nails, and a tapering tail. The mottling continues consistently across the back, flanks and tail in every rear view, and the bottom view shows a complete belly and four closed feet. 181,914 triangles with 2K-class textures. Unrigged.",
    "limitations": [
      "AI-assisted origin is disclosed upstream (origin.ai_content); some storefronts require an AI-content disclosure when you resell.",
      "Unrigged and unposed: the walking stance is baked into the mesh, so it cannot be re-posed or animated without adding a skeleton.",
      "No blend shapes or LODs are included."
    ],
